# Byte stability beats EOL niceties in this repository:
#   * `test/golden/**` is compared byte-for-byte by the renderer regression tests;
#   * `plugin/vendor/**` keeps upstream provenance recorded in NOTICE.md.
# Force LF in the repository AND in every checkout, so a Windows working tree
# (system core.autocrlf=true) can never rewrite a golden file behind our back.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Real binaries: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
